    "text": "If sum of all the solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mi>k</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to:"
